   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Layout only, no colors: the style comes in the mock-up. Two leads, each at phone (360 px) and computer (1280 px) width.\nA · One column, like the legal notice.   B · A timeline: the version and its date in a rail, the changes beside it.\nHeader: « v0.1.2 » is the link to this page, left of the flag. The texts are drafts of the notes of v0.1.0 to v0.1.2.",
   "originalText": "Layout only, no colors: the style comes in the mock-up. Two leads, each at phone (360 px) and computer (1280 px) width.\nA · One column, like the legal notice.   B · A timeline: the version and its date in a rail, the changes beside it.\nHeader: « v0.1.2 » is the link to this page, left of the flag. The texts are drafts of the notes of v0.1.0 to v0.1.2.",
