   "text": "1. A or B?\n2. A tag per change (New, Fixed, Improved),\n    or plain bullets?\n3. The donation line on this page too?\n    (specs: home and legal notice only)\n4. Download buttons on this page, under the\n    title, to update at once? (card below)\n5. The footer links here too, next to\n    « Legal notice »? (to compare in the mock-up)",
   "originalText": "1. A or B?\n2. A tag per change (New, Fixed, Improved),\n    or plain bullets?\n3. The donation line on this page too?\n    (specs: home and legal notice only)\n4. Download buttons on this page, under the\n    title, to update at once? (card below)\n5. The footer links here too, next to\n    « Legal notice »? (to compare in the mock-up)",
